  "prefLabel": "He-W 854.12 Other Excluded Income",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 854.12 Other Excluded Income.\n\n(a) Loans for personal or business reasons shall be excluded income and disregarded when determining eligibility for all categories of medical assistance.\n\n(b) For individuals receiving home and community based care services, the aid and attendance allowance shall be applied to the cost of care.\n\n(c) Income set aside under a Social Security Administration approved plan to achieve self support shall be excluded for the duration of the plan.\n\nSource. #13715, eff 8-8-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-w800.html"
}
